ram III represents a subspace. It represents the whole plane, which is considered a special subspace of ${R}^{2}.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"III only\"." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045249/state.json" "file_sha256" "d69d55414fec1fbdfb074ecc648f84bbc1400ac826d783e5b7649907ee3d09b2"} {"question" "q-34174" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045249/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "80f8cf5dcadec8f80f7d327e9e5b890f1e02b0f3bbca61f35f7c8d4db8d0c764"} {"question" "q-34174" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045249/state.json" "file_sha256" "d69d55414fec1fbdfb074ecc648f84bbc1400ac826d783e5b7649907ee3d09b2"} {"question" "q-34174" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "I, II and III"] ["text" "II only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045249/state.json" "file_sha256" "d69d55414fec1fbdfb074ecc648f84bbc1400ac826d783e5b7649907ee3d09b2"} {"question" "q-34174" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "III only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14045249/state.json" "file_sha256" "d69d55414fec1fbdfb074ecc648f84bbc1400ac826d783e5b7649907ee3d09b2"} {"question" "q-158029" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear